Overview

Built a custom home network infrastructure focused on performance, security, reliability,
and long-term expandability by replacing consumer ISP equipment with self-managed networking hardware.

Components

Router         | Custom PC-Based Router
Firewall OS    | OPNsense
Switch         | Managed Smart Switch
Wireless       | Mesh Wi-Fi Access Point
Rack Mount     | Network Rack Setup
Segmentation   | 2 VLANs Configured
ISP Equipment  | Bridged Modem/Gateway

Process

Built and installed a dedicated router using repurposed PC hardware.
Installed and configured OPNsense as the primary firewall and routing platform.
Converted ISP equipment to bridge mode and migrated the home network to the new router.
Installed a managed switch and mesh Wi-Fi access point for wired and wireless coverage.
Created two VLANs for network segmentation and improved traffic separation.
Tested connectivity, wireless performance, and device access across the network.

Skills Learned

Network architecture design
Firewall and router configuration
VLAN setup and segmentation
Managed switch configuration
Bridge mode migration
Mesh Wi-Fi deployment
Network troubleshooting
Infrastructure planning and scalability
